      "label": "Its a form of a pathogen carrier",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "And the apparent gap there between",
      "uuid": "f20a56892edc46178b63d77280207f51",
      "x": 5668.9950576561605,
      "y": -777.0876785964798,
      "width": 368.375,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.979000000000012,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "And the apparent gap there between",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Intentional",
      "uuid": "a32ed40597724a87acc32ce148823f2b",
      "x": 6010.380790370611,
      "y": -1515.033468431879,
      "width": 313.783682547785,
      "height": 173.8736450354091,
      "z_value": -9.989000000000006,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "It's a terrible name for a parable\nSince there are so many 1-2-3 rules in this world\nAnd it even uses base numbers for identifiers\nBut the message in it is solid\nAnd we named it this in a hurry\nSo we are sticking to it\nAnd just going to go with it"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Because the information has been converted to Three's local context",
      "uuid": "ab26192641df466fb94e5f5cd247eb35",
      "x": 5800.447519824891,
      "y": 1666.321502080567,
      "width": 698.0,
      "height": 29.0,
      "z_value": -9.960000000000022,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Because the information has been converted to Three's local context",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Sweet",
      "uuid": "428bdb943da848c9802b36fcd5a07a21",
      "x": 5950.442100384389,
      "y": -241.49663397451116,
      "width": 304.33896102795427,
      "height": 200.50267870725963,
      "z_value": -9.974000000000014,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The premise here then isnt any of us, the one, the five, the three, or anyone else included in this mess that you have made\n\nThe premise here, is the two and the four\nWhich aren't humans, just needed to get\nThe mental image of two humans distanced\nAnd you between them, clearly across\nBefore I tell you this"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Since the same offset between the Two exists within the Four",
      "uuid": "f119c1c2c9f947318048a46d16fcfbb2",
      "x": 6208.890971742134,
      "y": 2187.325189415693,
      "width": 628.0,
      "height": 29.0,
      "z_value": -9.956000000000024,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Since the same offset between the Two exists within the Four",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "At this point, Three feels he understands the situation perfectly",
      "uuid": "62cec36065a04f6a82271fef29357d6f",
      "x": 5747.358886860769,
      "y": 1590.5721474919478,
      "width": 678.0,
      "height": 29.0,
      "z_value": -9.961000000000022,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "At this point, Three feels he understands the situation perfectly",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "All Glory",
      "uuid": "46f2d63589fb449b909a8025068143af",
      "x": 5688.815320435911,
      "y": 735.3923364184907,
      "width": 293.3407227931909,
      "height": 227.2715419309552,
      "z_value": -9.967000000000018,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "By nature they exist on the same wave of existence\nSame humor level\nSame taste in things\nThey are each others type as the saying goes\nJust everything about One makes sense to Five\nWhile everything about Five makes sense to One\nThe kinda people who never need to ask each other questions\nAnd just matched as human beings \nThe moment they became aware of each others existences on Earth"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "In human communication",
      "uuid": "96a1bbe1a68a45caa224699acfa0cdbd",
      "x": 6061.862663375599,
      "y": 2724.781610755559,
      "width": 248.0,
      "height": 29.0,
      "z_value": -9.952000000000027,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "In human communication",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The Three",
      "uuid": "1729f5568cd5437a91a952ad8cf49d46",
      "x": 5891.692171142007,
      "y": -374.4352012230398,
      "width": 118.0,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.977000000000013,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "The Three",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Kinetic",
      "uuid": "6ce6fce578f04b4dbfb1e7b1797a847c",
      "x": 5620.223805842077,
      "y": -1195.907696293813,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 150.53458202160976,
      "z_value": -9.98300000000001,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The One, in this case, being me\nNot first, just wrap your mind\nwith the mental image of a human\nAs a single object, out of context with anything else, 1x Human"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Note",
      "uuid": "1392e02299fb450f8c1995169965ac18",
      "x": 5593.358723846133,
      "y": -1887.3660938788648,
      "width": 80.13053148639062,
      "height": 28.376843828796837,
      "z_value": -9.988000000000007,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Gentle",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Tiny little extra sprinkles of joy",
      "uuid": "bc1359e1f74c4c84a549b2a24aa77fe8",
      "x": 5609.400137238808,
      "y": 385.5415156343556,
      "width": 379.25867288188175,
      "height": 108.470584768153,
      "z_value": -9.970000000000017,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The four then being the transfer of understanding\nfrom your context to The Five"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The One",
      "uuid": "c2ef029a81554ff2a81fc8e8d757d21b",
      "x": 5499.125711354842,
      "y": -1177.232795788526,
      "width": 98.0,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.984000000000009,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "The One",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Onward",
      "uuid": "4bc2742cd3c5498eb662498b8511116a",
      "x": 6372.833981010015,
      "y": 2406.5139651269333,
      "width": 314.9049526332052,
      "height": 246.1946632874342,
      "z_value": -9.954000000000025,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The friction point happens\nBecause One and Five share the same lexicon\nBy default\nAnd when Three carries information\nBetween\nThe Two and Four\nAre so abtracted from the natural default\nThat now One and Five\nBoth perceive each other\nAs The Three\nWithout a single thing in either of their existences\nBeing remotely relative to anything either said or did"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Practical and pleasurable",
      "uuid": "115c1c9c25ea4c6ab467d7b49c0fbaed",
      "x": 5829.139223314691,
      "y": 1947.6953288010714,
      "width": 311.06058689904756,
      "height": 142.78540546043087,
      "z_value": -9.958000000000023,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "Now due to One and Five\nSharing the exact same plateu of existence on Earth\nAnd Three has gone ahead and converted it\nTo Three's contextual understanding"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Intricate",
      "uuid": "af6886176c0440679f592a67e63510ab",
      "x": 5832.883674107412,
      "y": 105.44359354416929,
      "width": 307.38912893931604,
      "height": 226.06448077781738,
      "z_value": -9.972000000000016,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The two in this case\nAnd as per all the other terrible namings in this parable has nothing to do with other representative usages of a one, or a Two, or Threes or anything of the sort\n\nThe two in this case, with that mental image in your mind.\n\nIs the transfer of understanding\nfrom my context to yours"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "",
      "uuid": "9799f9e1d3f24ba883de83e3094f1862",
      "x": 6055.85454242854,
      "y": 975.7792723087482,
      "width": 354.3647440371416,
      "height": 117.9693696240729,
      "z_value": -9.966000000000019,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "They both carry the same default lexicon of understanding\nAnd interpretations through life"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Clear enough?",
      "uuid": "c8472be5ea03493e8ade4b98e94f47a3",
      "x": 6197.295712507344,
      "y": 305.84205352167237,
      "width": 158.0,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.971000000000016,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Clear enough?",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "I named them like this to indicate the clear distance between",
      "uuid": "b5743ab9b4aa43be881d940eefde8132",
      "x": 5707.903664577185,
      "y": -930.1684694919419,
      "width": 638.375,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.980000000000011,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "I named them like this to indicate the clear distance between",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Golden Hour",
      "uuid": "3aef80ec1ec044e8a33168133ae310ca",
      "x": 5959.093452269553,
      "y": -1132.0277194563027,
      "width": 314.780797778211,
      "height": 148.04915626793314,
      "z_value": -9.98200000000001,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The Five, is her, again, not contextual to the other categories one, two, three, four\nAlso just an entity on its own merit\nIn it's own context"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "New Thought",
      "uuid": "154037acc8164a47b2eeebfd488c358f",
      "x": 5828.292101100495,
      "y": -597.5338119698414,
      "width": 327.64278182895896,
      "height": 161.9777266728933,
      "z_value": -9.978000000000012,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "This leaves room for the actual point to come there between so in this context I will number you three\n\nAnd you have the context of getting between us\nClear mental image of a human, between two other humans distanced"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Comes from a different environment",
      "uuid": "c7d6cb9d74eb4ee98d869b29ecacc647",
      "x": 5685.774756585466,
      "y": 1192.1300511265413,
      "width": 371.70659600924046,
      "height": 32.70659600924046,
      "z_value": -9.96400000000002,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Comes from a different environment",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Endless Potential",
      "uuid": "a2480e78898f44159ca26c9e8266fdc5",
      "x": 5678.565366453702,
      "y": -1408.662445626122,
      "width": 292.4603767279994,
      "height": 134.365506158776,
      "z_value": -9.987000000000007,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The most terrible thing about the name of this parable is the fact it doesn't even reference a linear thing then, as one would to be the suggestive title of naming it 1-2-3-4-5"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The One",
      "uuid": "c2543ad2a7c84486983b76fbe48d8b72",
      "x": 5646.2753043440825,
      "y": 47.67878821554905,
      "width": 98.0,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.976000000000013,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "The One",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Three however is different",
      "uuid": "ec8eeb0fe6eb4081bc80edb7ff2eb00a",
      "x": 5675.287962272567,
      "y": 1130.6958936010592,
      "width": 288.0,
      "height": 29.0,
      "z_value": -9.96500000000002,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Three however is different",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "The 1-2-3-4-5",
      "uuid": "d97669faed754bbb8705ee6810d7c427",
      "x": 5744.350675401336,
      "y": -1838.275848587618,
      "width": 304.1953855428355,
      "height": 300.5065914199974,
      "z_value": -9.999,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "Not like it's that other time when the idiot kept running to her and asking her questions about me and she had a near panic attack over who this rude monster was and freaked out.\n\nAnd then the idiot came back to me to tell me that she doesn't like me and had just totally freaked out when he mentioned me.\n\nThen later when me and her where talking we kept wondering who that idiot was and neither of us having the slightest idea why he was running between us.\n\nNah... the fact of the matter is neither of us like him, I responded the same way when you came tell me you have been harassing her didn't I ?"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The Five",
      "uuid": "4e8e0aee2d9b47888e27e631d958e26e",
      "x": 6319.616493573238,
      "y": -1040.7729633398944,
      "width": 108.0,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.98100000000001,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "The Five",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Good",
      "uuid": "41133439092d4dbfb821824e70578449",
      "x": 5948.4136502009715,
      "y": 2242.7760969949873,
      "width": 282.55159146239833,
      "height": 180.66700505307654,
      "z_value": -9.955000000000025,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The Five never received\nThe context of understanding from The One\n\nWhat five received\nwas the contextual abstraction\nThat The Three needed\nTo make sense of it in the first place\nIn it's own context"
    }
  ],
